flowchart TD
    U[User] --> API[FastAPI routes]
    API --> S[AgentPipelineState]
    S --> L[load_session]

    L --> P[PlannerAgent pass 1: action/tool]
    P -->|call_tool| A[PlannerAgent pass 2: args]
    A --> T[ToolExecutor]
    T --> G[AdequacyGate]
    G -->|insufficient| P
    G -->|adequate| C[answer_curator]

    P -->|clarify| CL[emit_agentic_clarify]
    P -->|answer| C

    T --> NTIS[NTIS tool backplane: search/lookup/manifest/response]
    NTIS --> OBS[Observation]
    OBS --> G

    C -->|response.* final_text| SAVE[save_session]
    C -->|CanonicalEvidence bundle| ANS[AnswerAgent]
    ANS --> CRIT[CriticAgent + grounding judge]
    CRIT -->|publish| SAVE
    CRIT -->|repair_answer| ANS
    CRIT -->|clarify| CL
    CRIT -->|internal_error| ERR[emit_internal_error]

    SAVE --> OUT[JSON/SSE answer]
    CL --> SAVE
    ERR --> OUT
